@startuml
title Detailed Sequence Diagram: UC-03 Asset Request & Approval
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

actor "Supervisor" as Sup
participant "MobileApp\n<<Flutter>>" as Mobile
participant "AssetController\n<<Node.js API>>" as API
database "MySQL\n<<Database>>" as DB
participant "WebDashboard\n<<React>>" as Web
actor "Manager" as Mgr

== Part 1: Supervisor Submits Request ==
Sup -> Mobile: Fill Asset Request (Item, Qty, Needed Date)
activate Mobile
Sup -> Mobile: Tap "Submit Request"

Mobile -> API: POST /api/assets (requestData)
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT INTO AssetRequests (ProjectID, Item, Qty, Status='Pending')
activate DB
DB --> API: return requestID
deactivate DB

API --> Mobile: HTTP 201 Created
deactivate API
Mobile --> Sup: Display "Request Sent to Manager"
deactivate Mobile

== Part 2: Manager Reviews Request ==
Mgr -> Web: Open Pending Asset Requests
activate Web
Web -> API: GET /api/assets?status=pending
activate API
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM AssetRequests WHERE Status='Pending'
activate DB
DB --> API: return rows
deactivate DB
API --> Web: JSON Array (requests)
deactivate API
Web --> Mgr: Display List of Pending Requests

Mgr -> Web: Click "Approve" on Request
Web -> API: PUT /api/assets/{requestID} (status='Approved')
activate API
API -> DB: UPDATE AssetRequests SET Status='Approved' WHERE ID={requestID}
activate DB
DB --> API: return success
deactivate DB
API --> Web: HTTP 200 OK
deactivate API
Web --> Mgr: Display "Request Approved"
deactivate Web

@enduml